  20:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_sd.c ****                      ##### How to use this driver #####
  21:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_sd.c ****   ==============================================================================
  22:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_sd.c ****    - This driver is used to drive the micro SD external card mounted on the
  23:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_sd.c ****      STM32N6570_DK board.
  24:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_sd.c ****    - This driver does not need a specific component driver for the micro SD device
  25:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_sd.c ****      to be included with.
  26:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_sd.c **** 
  27:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_sd.c ****   Driver description:
  28:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_sd.c ****   ------------------
  29:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_sd.c ****   + Initialization steps:
  30:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_sd.c ****      o Initialize the micro SD card using the BSP_SD_Init() function. This
  31:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_sd.c ****        function includes the MSP layer hardware resources initialization and the
  32:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_sd.c ****        SDIO interface configuration to interface with the external micro SD. It
  33:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_sd.c ****        also includes the micro SD initialization sequence for instance 0.
  34:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_sd.c **** 
  35:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_sd.c ****      o To check the SD card presence you can use the function BSP_SD_IsDetected() which
  36:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_sd.c ****        returns the detection status for instance 0.
  37:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_sd.c **** 
  38:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_sd.c ****      o If SD presence detection interrupt mode is desired, you must configure the
  39:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_sd.c ****        SD detection interrupt mode by calling the function BSP_SD_DetectITConfig().
  40:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_sd.c ****        The interrupt is generated as an external interrupt whenever the micro SD card is
  41:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_sd.c ****        plugged/unplugged in/from the discovery board.
  42:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_sd.c ****      The SD detection interrupt is handled by calling the function BSP_SD_DetectIT()
  43:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_sd.c ****        which is called in the IRQ handler file, the user callback is implemented in
  44:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_sd.c ****      the function BSP_SD_DetectCallback().
  45:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_sd.c **** 
  46:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_sd.c ****      o The function BSP_SD_GetCardInfo()are used to get the micro SD card information
  47:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_sd.c ****        which is stored in the structure "HAL_SD_CardInfoTypedef".
  48:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_sd.c **** 
  49:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_sd.c ****   + Micro SD card operations
  50:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_sd.c ****      o The micro SD card can be accessed with read/write block(s) operations once
  51:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_sd.c ****        it is ready for access. The access can be performed whether
ARM GAS  C:\Users\Antonio\AppData\Local\Temp\cc68a1Gh.s 			page 28


  52:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_sd.c ****        using the polling mode by calling the functions BSP_SD_ReadBlocks()/BSP_SD_WriteBlocks(),
  53:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_sd.c ****        using the interrupt mode by calling the functions BSP_SD_ReadBlocks_IT()/BSP_SD_WriteBlocks_
  54:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_sd.c ****        or by DMA transfer using the functions BSP_SD_ReadBlocks_DMA()/BSP_SD_WriteBlocks_DMA().
  55:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_sd.c ****        The access can be performed to instance 0.
  56:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_sd.c **** 
  57:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_sd.c ****      o The DMA transfer complete is used with interrupt mode. Once the SD transfer
  58:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_sd.c ****        is complete, the SD interrupt is handled using the function BSP_SD_IRQHandler()
  59:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_sd.c ****        when instance 0 is used.
  60:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_sd.c ****        The DMA Tx/Rx transfer complete are handled using the functions
  61:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_sd.c ****        SD_SDMMC1_DMA_Tx_IRQHandler(), SD_SDMMC1_DMA_Rx_IRQHandler(). The corresponding
  62:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_sd.c ****        user callbacks are implemented by the user at application level.
  63:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_sd.c **** 
  64:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_sd.c ****      o The SD erase block(s) is performed using the functions BSP_SD_Erase() with specifying
  65:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_sd.c ****        the number of blocks to erase.
  66:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_sd.c **** 
  67:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_sd.c ****      o The SD runtime status is returned when calling the function BSP_SD_GetCardState().
  68:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_sd.c **** 
  69:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_sd.c ****   @endverbatim
  70:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_sd.c ****   ******************************************************************************
  71:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_sd.c ****   */
  72:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_sd.c **** 
